PTX 2+add.cluster+same-cluster
"Atomic adds at .cluster scope from two CTAs of one cluster: atomic. Expected: forbidden."
{
x=0;
P0:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0          | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0          ;
 atom.relaxed.cluster.add r0, x, 1 | atom.relaxed.cluster.add r1, x, 1 ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 0 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
